  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-db485be5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into rounds.\n• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.\n• Thinly slice mint.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-c5a95eae.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, add a pinch of salt, and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-bdf74a8c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded. Remove from heat, drizzle over the honey and turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-62816283.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once veggies have cooled, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of vinegar to the tray.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• In a small bowl, add mint and Greek-style yoghurt. Sir until combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-252603bf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread babaganoush on the base of the serving bowls.\n• Top with roast veggies and haloumi.\n• Drizzle over mint- yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b1a6a8ad42be8e34601b9-803c2f1e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
